<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Harsco started as a buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Harsco started as a buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Bros analyst Donald Zwyer said in a research note that he initiated coverage of Harsco Corp with a buy recommendation.</p>
<p>-- 1996 earnings estimate is $4.65, and 1997 is $5.20. The company earned $4.18 in 1995, he said.</p>
<p>-- Price target is $73 per share based on 14 times estimated 1997 earnings.</p>
<p>-- Shares were unchanged at 60-5/8 in midday New York Stock Exchange trade.</p>
